raw_output:
{"code": "C43", "condition": "Malignant melanoma of skin"} 

 Wait, mucosal melanoma of the hard palate is coded in ICD-10-AM under C06 (malignant neoplasm of other and unspecified parts of mouth), with the palate specifically at C05. Corrected response: 

 {"code": "C05", "condition": "Malignant neoplasm of palate (mucosal melanoma of hard palate)"}

{"code": "N41", "condition": "Xanthogranulomatous pyelonephritis"} 

 Wait, that code is wrong: N41 is prostatitis. Corrected: 

 {"code": "N11", "condition": "Chronic obstructive pyelonephritis (xanthogranulomatous pyelonephritis)"}
